  "html": "<article id=\"post-6530\" class=\"container post-6530 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-indoor-air-quality area-of-service-indoor-air-quality-chesapeake-va area-of-service-air-filter-systems\">\n<div class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg><span >Blog Posts</span>\n\n</a></div>\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h1 class=\"entry-title has-secondary-color mt-3\">Indoor Air Quality &#8211; Do you know what pollutants might be lurking in your home?</h1>\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"posted-on p-sm\">Published on <span><time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2024-10-04T02:30:38+00:00\">October 4, 2024</time><time class=\"updated\" datetime=\"2025-04-12T01:38:52+00:00\">April 12, 2025</time></span></span>\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"IAQ air filtration system in Chesapeake, VA to benefit indoor air quality\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image.jpg 1920w, /images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" title=\"IAQ air filtration system in Chesapeake, VA to benefit indoor air quality - Russell’s American Mechanical\" />\t\t\t</figure><!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | asymmetric-container | mb-5\">\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-main blog--main flow\">\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Testing your <a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality-chesapeake-va\">indoor air quality</a> (IAQ) can reveal the answer!</strong></p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Improving Indoor Air Quality: Assess, Act, Protect</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">IAQ plays a crucial role in the comfort, health, and well-being of everyone in your home. At Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical, we emphasize the importance of maintaining high IAQ to reduce allergens, pollutants, and contaminants that can affect your breathing and overall health. By following a simple approach of <strong>Assess</strong>, <strong>Act</strong>, <strong>Protect</strong>, you can ensure cleaner, healthier air inside your home.</p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Assess: Review Your Air Quality</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The first step to improving your indoor air quality is a thorough <strong>assessment</strong>. Many pollutants, such as dust, mold, germs, viruses, and volatile organic compounds (VOCs) – harmful gases emitted by certain solids or liquids – can go unnoticed without proper testing. By identifying these hidden contaminants, you can take targeted action to reduce health risks and create a cleaner, safer environment in your home. Proper IAQ testing ensures you’re protected from airborne pollutants, helping to prevent the spread of germs and viruses while improving overall air quality. <strong>By testing your home’s air quality, you can identify common issues such as:</strong></p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Allergens</strong>: Dust, pollen, pet hair, and other allergens can trigger respiratory issues or aggravate allergies severely.<br></li>\n\n<li><strong>Mold spores</strong>: High humidity or moisture in the home can lead to mold growth, which can seriously impact indoor air quality. This can also impact you without you be aware. If not treated, this can be hazardous for humans, pets, and the quality of your home.<br></li>\n\n<li><strong>Chemical pollutants</strong>: Cleaning products, paints, and other household items often release VOCs that can contribute to poor air quality. With new brands across the marketplace selling more organic and “greener” solutions, this can be easily solved by switching to healthier options instead of bleach and hazardous materials. There is also a wide range of various “<em>recipes</em>” for at-home DIY and easy-on-your-wallet solutions such as mixtures with baking soda, vinegar, handmade bathroom cleaner soaps, and the like.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><em>Our IAQ testing services provide a comprehensive analysis, helping you identify harmful substances and make informed decisions about how to address them.</em></h4>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Act: Addressing IAQ Issues</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Once the issues are identified, it’s essential to treat them promptly to improve your home’s air quality. Common treatments include:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Air filtration systems</strong>: Installing high-efficiency air filters or air purifiers can remove particles and pollutants from the air, creating a cleaner environment.<br></li>\n\n<li><strong>Ventilation improvements</strong>: Poor ventilation can trap pollutants indoors. Upgrading or repairing your ventilation system allows fresh air to circulate more freely, diluting pollutants. Again, poor ventilation can equal allergy issues, severe illness and colds circulating in the household.<br></li>\n\n<li><strong>Humidity control</strong>: Mold thrives in humid conditions. Dehumidifiers or HVAC adjustments can help maintain optimal humidity levels, preventing mold growth and improving overall air quality as well as quality of life.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Actively treating air quality issues creates a healthier living environment for your family and home! If you are planning on selling in the future, you will want to make sure your home is mold-free for obvious selling points and the safety of the new homeowner. This will also save you time, money and stress by handling this ahead of time prior to a closing.</p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Protect: Maintaining Healthy Air Quality</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Preventive steps are key to maintaining high IAQ over time. With the right precautions, you can keep pollutants at bay and enjoy cleaner air year-round. Here are a few strategies:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Routine HVAC maintenance</strong>: Regular maintenance, including cleaning and replacing filters, helps your HVAC system perform better and reduces the buildup of contaminants in the air.<br></li>\n\n<li><strong>Proper ventilation</strong>: Ensure that your home has the proper balance of airflow by using ventilation systems, exhaust fans, and even opening windows when appropriate. Especially moving into the colder months, this is vital to keep germs at bay and illness away.<br></li>\n\n<li><strong>Use of air purifiers</strong>: Invest in air purifiers with HEPA filters, which can capture up to 99.97% of airborne particles, ensuring your indoor air stays clean and fresh. This is important for families, pets and quality of life at your home.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By implementing preventive measures, you’ll be able to enjoy long-term improvements to your indoor air quality. Remember, the goal is to, <strong>Assess, Act, Protect!</strong></p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Indoor air quality is an essential part of a healthy home environment. We Assess, Act, Protect approach to IAQ ensures that your air is clean and safe, providing peace of mind for you and your loved ones. Whether you need an IAQ assessment or assistance with air filtration systems, NearU is here to help. Contact us today to schedule a consultation and breathe easier!</p>\n\n<div class=\"aioseo-author-bio-compact\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"aioseo-author-bio-compact-left\">\n\t\t\t<img class=\"aioseo-author-bio-compact-image\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7ac5b447183d176a95f013bbac6db80bfaf1d45c568f44676b19f7dc18387a2c?s=300&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g\" alt=\"author avatar\"/>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"aioseo-author-bio-compact-right\">\n\t\t<div class=\"aioseo-author-bio-compact-header\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"author-name\">nearu</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"aioseo-author-bio-compact-main\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"author-bio-link\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/author/nearu\">See Full Bio</a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/author/nearu\" aria-label=\"See Full Bio\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\txmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\twidth=\"16\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\theight=\"17\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tviewBox=\"0 0 16 17\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfill=\"none\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<path\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\td=\"M5.52978 5.44L8.58312 8.5L5.52979 11.56L6.46979 12.5L10.4698 8.5L6.46978 4.5L5.52978 5.44Z\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"aioseo-author-bio-compact-footer\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-side blog--sidebar\">\n\t\t\t<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Have a question?\" aria-label=\"Have a question?\">Have a question?</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><div class=\"flow\"><p>Let’s connect and have a quick conversation to see how we can help.</p>\n<a href=\"tel:+17575254911\" aria-label=\"Call now: +17575254911\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=